  characterName: "Mwanajuma Hassan \u25CF \u25CF \u25CB"
  promptText: 'Child, I live in Mohamed''s village. Industrial trawlers came this
    week, dragging chains across our reef. Suddenly the souvenirs look like a small
    problem.


    Do I lead my community to fight for the reef?'
  leftAnswer: Rally the village. Together you are harder to ignore.
  rightAnswer: Hold back. keep the community safe and seek another way.
